TESSERAE CORE INDEX
Version: 0.1
Author: mensura-one
Status: Contestable

FAMILY 1 — Invariant
What must remain true.
Cannot bend. Cannot be traded.
If violated, the instance is broken.

FAMILY 2 — Constraint
What bounds the inquiry.
Can bend under pressure.
Bending must be declared, not silent.

FAMILY 3 — Tradeoff
What is in tension.
Two things that cannot both be fully satisfied.
User declares which weighs heavier.

---
Notes:
- Family numbers do not imply execution order
- Decimals hold nuance within a family
- All IDs are unique identifiers
- This index is the seed. Community proposes additions.


